{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29086","headline":"题故李秀才居 · 许浑","name":"题故李秀才居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾醉笙歌日正迟，醉中相送易前期。\n橘花满地人亡後，菰叶连天鴈过时。\n琴倚旧窗尘漠漠，剑埋新塚草离离。\n河桥酒熟平生事，更向东流奠一巵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29086.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29086","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}